&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;米国イリノイ州にFUJIKURA GRAPHICS,INC.(現連結子会社)を設立。&lt;/p&gt;
